{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q387505","formula":"C₁₅H₁₈O₄","hill":"C15H18O4","elements":["H","C","O"],"composition":{"C":15.0,"H":18.0,"O":4.0},"names":{"en":"Helenalin"},"descriptions":{"en":"Helenalin, or (-)-4-Hydroxy-4a,8-dimethyl-3,3a,4a,7a,8,9,9a-octahydroazuleno[6,5-b]furan-2,5-dione, is a toxic sesquiterpene lactone which can be found in several plants such as Arnica montana and Arnica chamissonis Helenalin is responsible for the toxicity of the Arnica spp. Although toxic, helenalin possesses some in vitro anti-inflammatory and anti-neoplastic effects. Helenalin can inhibit certain enzymes, such as 5-lipoxygenase and leukotriene C4 synthase."},"fame":14,"pubchemCid":23205,"mass":262.3,"charge":0,"smiles":"C[C@@H]1C[C@@H]2[C@H]([C@@H]([C@]3([C@H]1C=CC3=O)C)O)C(=C)C(=O)O2","inchikey":"ZVLOPMNVFLSSAA-XEPQRQSNSA-N","iupac":"(3aR,5R,5aR,8aR,9S,9aS)-9-hydroxy-5,8a-dimethyl-1-methylidene-3a,4,5,5a,9,9a-hexahydroazuleno[6,7-b]furan-2,8-dione","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"pubchem","ref":"23205","atoms":37,"license":"PubChem (NIH), public data"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":2.827,"y":1.017,"z":-0.641,"el":"O"},{"x":-0.797,"y":-1.252,"z":-2.0,"el":"O"},{"x":-2.929,"y":-2.291,"z":0.028,"el":"O"},{"x":4.48,"y":-0.155,"z":0.46,"el":"O"},{"x":-1.256,"y":-0.514,"z":0.271,"el":"C"},{"x":-1.539,"y":0.953,"z":-0.145,"el":"C"},{"x":-0.249,"y":-1.205,"z":-0.668,"el":"C"},{"x":-0.663,"y":2.023,"z":0.525,"el":"C"},{"x":1.167,"y":-0.607,"z":-0.781,"el":"C"},{"x":1.376,"y":0.912,"z":-0.722,"el":"C"},{"x":0.845,"y":1.709,"z":0.482,"el":"C"},{"x":-2.657,"y":-1.103,"z":0.121,"el":"C"},{"x":-0.916,"y":-0.737,"z":1.757,"el":"C"},{"x":-3.024,"y":1.098,"z":0.082,"el":"C"},{"x":2.248,"y":-1.047,"z":0.152,"el":"C"},{"x":-0.905,"y":3.402,"z":-0.118,"el":"C"},{"x":-3.687,"y":-0.056,"z":0.179,"el":"C"},{"x":3.339,"y":-0.049,"z